# Recommended .gitignore for Unreal Engine 5 Projects with Local Art Vault Strategy

# Local Asset Vault & External Art Targets (Ignored to prevent binary bloat)
Content/ArtVault/
Content/Assets/External/
Content/LevelPrototyping/External/
*.uasset.bak
*.umap.bak

# Unreal Engine Generated & Intermediate Folders
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/

# Visual Studio & C++ IDE Transient Files
.vs/
*.vsidx
*.VC.db*
v17/
v18/
.vsconfig
*.sln
*.slnx
*.vcxproj*

# Python Local Cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
